## 5. Evidence index (where each claim comes from)

- Desktop starts the server in-process: `app.asar` → `dist-bundle/main.mjs` (`startWebUiServer`,
  `LOCAL_DESKTOP_CLIENT_KIND="desktop-local"`).
- Server routes: `@openchamber/web/server/lib/opencode/core-routes.js` (`/api/client-auth/*`,
  `pairingServerCandidates`, `resolveDirectLanUrls`, `resolvePairingTransports` in
  `server/index.js`).
